    },
    {
      "text": "Trapped later in soul taker battlefield fog, He Feng Yang asks Lord Tiger Demon’s anger will to use force intrusion again; the will warns that each cast costs the main body two red date immortal essence beads, and He Feng Yang promises compensation. After the will feeds those two beads and many mortal Gu into Expand Space, He Feng Yang brings the yellow-lit Immortal Gu out, pats it, and the light breaks a hole in the battlefield so his nine palace crane can carry him into clear sky.",
